-- src:504 | điều kiện chưa có bồi thường phát sinh tính đến ngày hủy.
GIVEN `the person's premium`    IS A NUMBER
      `the day of cancellation` IS A DATE
      `the contract`            IS A `The contract`
      `a claim has arisen`      IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the refund of` `the person's premium` `cancelled on` `the day of cancellation` `under` `the contract` `if a claim has arisen` `a claim has arisen` MEANS
    IF   `a claim has arisen`
    THEN 0
    ELSE `the person's premium` TIMES `the share of the period remaining after` `the day of cancellation` `under` `the contract`

§§ `6. When the benefits end`

-- All benefits end at midnight on the last day of the period, or on the termination day
-- the policyholder notifies, whichever is earlier. But for Benefit 1, an insured injured in
-- the period by a cause independent of all others, who dies or is totally disabled within
-- two years, is paid.
